Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/controller/placement-plans/homes/PLACE-RULING.md` (plan, file date 2026-11-10); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/controller/placement-plans/homes/index]].

